Z||000008||FieroLisa||08-14-2001||12:41 PM||||John, why yes, they are off the '79, Mustang... Jonathan McCreery has one on his GT, and I will get one, one of these days!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> If you look on ebay you can find them, and on my other computer I have a website addy that sells replica scoops from the '79 Mustang for 70 bucks. Good deal, I think.<P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.webjolt.f2s.com/pictures/fierolisa.gif">    <BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A><P>AIM: FieroLisa||||reg||1
