Z||000010||qwikgta||08-14-2001||09:34 PM||||Just a word of caution, I got one off ebay from a site called MPMotorsports.  THey sell aftermarket fiberglass stuff, I didn't like the quality of the product, just be warned.  I did get a true "Ford" scoop off ebay last week, it came off a 79 Rustang GT.  I got it for $20.00, i was the only bidder.  I say go for the genuine Ford part over a fiberglass aftermarket, JMO<P>Rob||||reg||1
